{"id":"cita","lemma":"cita","pos":"noun","rank":512,"glosses":["date (romantic outing)","appointment","quote, quotation"],"ipa":"/ˈθita/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"citas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-cita.wav","formAudio":{"citas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-citas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Adónde piensas ir esta noche en tu cita?","en":"Where are you going on your date tonight?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806204","words":[{"g":"to where"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"night"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Mi cita es a las dos y media.","en":"My appointment is at 2:30.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302870","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"half"}]},{"text":"¿Tienes cita con él?","en":"Do you have an appointment with him?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534428","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"he"}]},{"text":"Las citas pueden ser muy estresantes.","en":"Dating can be very stressful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582472","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"stressful","l":"estresante"}]},{"text":"Tras tantas citas, por fin se besaron.","en":"After so many dates, they finally kissed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689198","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"copy","l":"tanto"},null,null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to kiss","l":"besar"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"finally"]]}]}